  "id": "sle",
  "term": "SLE",
  "definition": "SLE, or systemic lupus erythematosus, is a chronic autoimmune disease that can affect multiple organs and is linked with difficulties in emotion and mood regulation. In psychology-related contexts, it is associated with higher stress, depression, and anxiety, along with reduced quality of life and daily functioning.",
